<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 70-1 V ENGLAND (77) IN SECOND TEST - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 70-1 V ENGLAND (77) IN SECOND TEST - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 70 for one at tea,</p>
<p>seven runs behind England's first innings total of 77 on the</p>
<p>third day of the second test against Australia at Lord's on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
</text>
